Verdict
-------
F-QM-2-SURF-12 = PASS
Reason: logical_zero_ratio=1.0000 >= 0.99 AND min_stab_plus_ratio=1.0000 >= 0.99

Why deterministic: |0_L> = (|000>+|111>)^{tensor 3} / 2sqrt(2) is a SIMULTANEOUS
+1 eigenstate of all 8 stabilizers (Z_iZ_j on intra-block: even Z parity in
each branch; X_1, X_2 on weight-6: each X-stab is the product of two block
GHZ-3 stabilizers X0X1X2 + X3X4X5 each of which is the X-symmetry of the
GHZ-3, so leaves |0_L> invariant). Aer state-vector with no noise channel
samples the unique deterministic outcome on every shot.

